      "message": "feat(browser): extend auth readback, reload gate and session continuity to the GLM platform\n\nThe 2026-09-17 logout amplifier incident protections now cover the\nfleet's actual platform (chat.z.ai, auth surface /auth):\n\n- chatgpt-auth-readback: combined v2 classifier watches BOTH chat\n  surfaces (agent platform + legacy operator lane) with per-platform\n  counts and aggregates; single-URL classifyChatAuthUrl and\n  isChatAuthRedirectUrl cover both platforms.\n- reload-auth-redirect-gate: RELOAD stays forbidden on any monitored\n  chat auth-redirect surface - chatgpt.com/auth/* and chat.z.ai/auth*.\n- self-update-session-continuity: restore latches AUTH_REQUIRED and\n  skips chat-surface tabs across both platforms; post-update\n  qualification uses the combined readback, so a GLM logout survives a\n  self-update without minting login tabs.\n- native-supervisor-client-base: heartbeat auth evidence reports the\n  combined classifier.\n\nFull suite 2373 pass / 0 fail; security static gate clean.",
